dItem_1","default":"<p>SHIPPING INFORMATION</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_2","label":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_2","default":"<p>WHAT CAN IT HELP ME WITH?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_3","label":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_3","default":"<p>PRODUCT INFORMATION</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_4","label":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_4","default":"<p>SIZE &amp; PACKAGE</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_5","label":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_5","default":"<p>IMPORTANT DISCLAIMER</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeky56BLVe_text","label":"ggeky56BLVe_text","default":"<p>To put on the Gudslip® Travel Pillow, simply follow these steps:</p><p><strong>- Position the Pillow: </strong>Hold the travel pillow around your neck with the opening at the back.</p><p><strong>- Adjust for Comfort: </strong>Arrange the pillow until it feels comfortable, making sure it supports your neck and chin.</p><p><strong>- Secure the Velcro: </strong>The pillow features a Velcro strap as its closure system. Pull the Velcro strip, and then adjust the tightness to fit snugly around your neck.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>To put on the Gudslip® Blindfold, follow these steps:</p><p><strong>- Place it</strong> over your eyes, ensuring it covers them completely to block out light.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>- Adjust </strong>the strap at the back for a snug but comfortable fit, making sure it’s not too tight.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>- Secure</strong> the strap once you’ve achieved the perfect fit.&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQa8E07dJW_text","label":"ggQa8E07dJW_text","default":"<p>- FREE Shipping on orders +49€<br>&nbsp;</p><p>- Spain and Portugal orders 1-3 working days</p><p>- Rest of Europe orders 3-5 working days approximately.</p><p>- Latin America orders 10-15 working days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shipment tracking ID will be provided after your product(s) is dispatched.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGkzOF8L4W_text","label":"ggGkzOF8L4W_text","default":"<p><strong>Prevent Torticollis: </strong>Ensures proper neck alignment to avoid stiffness and discomfort.</p><p><br><strong>Enhance Travel Rest: </strong>Offers personalized support for better sleep on any journey.</p><p><br><strong>Reduce Fatigue: </strong>Helps you arrive refreshed by mitigating travel-related fatigue.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcx6K9I5mh_text","label":"ggcx6K9I5mh_text","default":"<p><strong>Gudslip® Travel Pillow:</strong></p><p><strong>- Material: </strong>Crafted with high-quality viscoelastic memory foam.<br><strong>- Design:</strong> Features a 360-degree ergonomic support system.<br><strong>- Size: </strong>Compact and portable, easily compressible to fit into the included travel bag.<br><strong>- Features: </strong>Equipped with an adjustable Velcro closure for a secure and personalized fit.</p><p><br><strong>Gudslip® Blindfold:</strong></p><p><strong>- Material: </strong>Made from a soft, breathable fabric that is gentle on your skin and comfortable for long wear.<br><strong>- Design: </strong>Total blackout capability to effectively block all light, enhancing your ability to sleep in any environment.<br><strong>- Size: </strong>One-size-fits-all with an adjustable strap to accommodate all head sizes.<br><strong>- Features: </strong>Lightweight and folds easily, making it perfect for on-the-go use in your travel kit.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0YP1gUAIe_text","label":"gg0YP1gUAIe_text","default":"<p>Travel Pillow:</p><p><strong>Dimensions:</strong> Ergonomically designed to fit around most neck sizes comfortably.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Compression: </strong>Compresses down to 60% of its full size, making it easy to fit into your travel bag or backpack.</p><p><br><strong>Travel Bag Included: </strong>Each pillow comes with a stylish and durable travel bag for added convenience and protection.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Blindfold:</p><p><strong>Dimensions: </strong>Designed to fit comfortably across various face shapes and sizes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Compression: </strong>Flexible and lightweight, easily folds into a compact form, ideal for minimalistic packing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Bag Included: </strong>Each blindfold comes with a stylish bag featuring a zipper for secure storage.<br>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBqOnSSmnz_text","label":"ggBqOnSSmnz_text","default":"<p>While Gudslip® Tape is generally safe. Do not use Gudslip® Tape if you have trouble breathing through your nose. Do not use by itself without a CPAP if you are obese (BMI over 35), Do not use if you have very low blood pressure. Do not use if you have severe heart or breathing problems, or if you have a cold, sinus, or ear infection. Do not use if you have severely chapped lips or non-intact skin immediately around the mouth, or after consuming alcohol or sedatives.</p>"}],
